    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22083932
    description: >-
      Version DOI for 0.6.0. Cite this one in a thesis or paper: it resolves
      to a frozen copy of the code that produced the results, and cannot move.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22083931
